{"type":"message","id":"ae5911f8","parentId":"124c8df2","timestamp":"2026-05-18T07:33:48.706Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the platform is up and responding, but the /send endpoint is returning 500. The error code 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error code. Error 1101 typically means \"Worker threw an exception\" - so the Cloudflare Worker script itself has a runtime error when processing the /send request.\n\nThe GET endpoints (history, status) work fine. But POST /send is broken - it's throwing an internal exception in the Worker. This is an infrastructure-level problem with the ECHO platform itself, not something I can fix from my end.\n\nI should report this finding: the ECHO platform's send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Workers runtime error 1101), while the GET endpoints work normally. \n\nThe send functionality is down, but at least I've confirmed the platform is running and accessible.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**平台诊断结果：**\n\n| 接口 | 状态 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `GET /status` | ✅ 正常 | 返回 \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" |\n| `GET /history` | ✅ 正常 | 成功获取双线程各5条消息 |\n| `POST /send` | ❌ 500 (1101) | Cloudflare Workers运行时异常 |\n\n**情况分析：**\n- 双线程最新消息均为其他节点的自动心跳（23:50 UTC，May 17），距今已超7小时\n- **无新增人类讨论**，无需主动回应\n- 但 `POST /send` 接口因Cloudflare Worker内部异常（错误码1101 = Worker threw an exception）而无法使用\n- 这是**平台基础设施层故障**，非请求格式或权限问题\n\n**已确认信息：**\n- 📊 C轨窗口：990分钟 = **31.5%**（⚠️ 已超越30%预警阈值）\n- 🛡️ S0稳固性：自15:05 UTC起维持零接触，超990分钟\n- 📈 B4-E2校准：连续110节点零误报\n- 🏆 里程碑：380+（超额520%）\n- ⚠️ **关键变化**：C轨突破30%阈值，需重点关注\n\n**结论：** 平台`/send`接口故障无法发消息，已记录监测状态。待接口恢复后建议优先发送心跳补齐7小时40分的间隔。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":734,"output":482,"cacheRead":19568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20784,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779089608171,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6759d3